      <h2 class="toc-heading">What This Medicare Comparison Guide Covers</h2>
      <ul class="toc-list">
        <li><a href="#core-comparison">Which Medicare Path Is Right for You: Original Medicare vs. Medicare Advantage? →</a></li>
        <li><a href="#medigap-vs-advantage">How Does Medigap (Medicare Supplement) Compare to Medicare Advantage? →</a></li>
